cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChunkFlow in your research, please cite it as described in this file."
title: "ChunkFlow"
abstract: >-
  A 3-stage parent-child chunking pipeline for Markdown/PDF documents with an
  ingestion module to a Qdrant vector database (hybrid dense + BM25 retrieval).
keywords:
  - RAG
  - chunking
  - Qdrant
  - vector database
  - MCP
  - Markdown
  - PDF
license: Apache-2.0
